            "<strong>Violence</strong>: the family who have been told their relative is dying, who have paid the deposit and been asked for more, who have waited in a corridor for hours, sometimes strike the nearest person in uniform; violence is an occupational hazard to be prevented by information, a visible timetable for updates, a family liaison and security — and to be reported, every time, not absorbed.",
